<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-1030-6"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" align="center" valign="top" style="width: 100%;"> 
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #147bd1;">With Flywire, seamlessly receive and reconcile payments from domestic and international students, all from within a single solution.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">As the number of international and domestic students continues to grow, many Canadian institutions are forced to use different payment systems and tools to process student payments, increasing the costs and complexity of their financial operations.<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">On top of this painful process, we know you’re also looking for ways to make education payments easier and more affordable for students and their families.<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Wouldn’t it be nice to simplify?<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">That’s why Flywire is thrilled to offer <a href="https://www.flywire.com/news/flywire-expands-education-business-in-canada?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>new capabilities to the Canadian market</u></strong></span></a> through our Comprehensive Receivables Solution - including international cross-border and domestic payments, payment plans, A/R Collect and more.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>What makes Flywire’s Comprehensive Receivables Solution the trusted choice for Simon Fraser University?<br /><br /></strong></span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">"The payment solutions that Flywire offers are important to Simon Fraser University now more than ever. For both our domestic and international students, the pandemic has precipitated the need for digital, flexible payment options that let students pay on their own terms, in a way that makes the cost of their education more manageable. Flywire meets our students' needs, and saves us valuable time and resources."</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><em><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">&nbsp;- Korina Chu, Director, Student Financials, Simon Fraser University</span></em></p> </td> 
</tr> 
