<tr> 
<td width="100%" align="center" valign="top" style="width: 100%;"> 
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">To learn more, we’ve put together the following resources:<br />‌<br /></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-left: 15px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-position: inside; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"><strong>Press Release</strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">: </span></span><a href="https://www.flywire.com/news/flywire-expands-education-business-in-canada?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Expands Education Business in Canada</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"><strong>Virtual Roadshow: </strong></span></span><a href="https://more.flywire.com/canadian_virtualroadshow_registration.html?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Canadian Higher Education</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"> on June 24 at 2pm ET | 11am PT</span></span></li> 
<li style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"><strong>Industry Events:</strong> Flywire is exhibiting at the ongoing </span></span><a href="https://global.mcmaster.ca/events/oaie2021-ontario-regional-meeting/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Ontario Association of International Education (OAIE) Regional Meeting</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"> and the </span></span><a href="https://www.cvent.com/events/caubo-2021-annual-conference/event-summary-89b3d6192b944c00919a27e4e2a69d55.aspx?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;lang=en" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Canadian Association of University Business Officers (CAUBO) 2021 Annual Conference</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;"> from June 15 - 17.</span></span></li> 
<li style="color: #48b985;"><strong><span style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #223341;">Learn More: </span></span></strong><a href="https://assets.flywire.com/collateral/education/clients/Flywire_EDU_CRSBrochure_Canada.pdf?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Comprehensive Receivables Solutions Brochure</u></strong></span></a></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">If you’d like to talk about how to bring Flywire’s Comprehensive Receivables Solution to your institution, <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/solution?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="color: #48b985;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>request a demo here</u></strong></span></a></span></span>, and we will be in touch!<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Best, </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The Flywire Team</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
